{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When civilization is decimated by rampant plague, a lucky few emerge from the ashes. Help them settle in a dangerous wilderness reclaimed by nature. Build them a home, shape their lives, and defend them from bandits and beasts in a lawless, realistic post-calamity world. The Dark Age is yours to rebuild. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5ed2d2f81df4483c2d08aaad7b3a4c1f.avif?t=1776423113\" width=637 height=68 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/67117a3652f18508f9e4abc33263b697.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/04acb3ed94691e24de9c6e408a45a62e.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/04acb3ed94691e24de9c6e408a45a62e.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/04acb3ed94691e24de9c6e408a45a62e.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From three lost travellers to a thriving walled city, build greatness from desolation. Use 3D terrain tools to create the perfect stronghold, from sprawling multi-storey forts to winding underground caverns. Construct, furnish and decorate your chambers, workshops, chapels, libraries and more, using stone, clay, and other gathered materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/a5299e73ceeba5b0700669c2d8d3ffe4.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/132979694ed6c10a8bf29caa6cd3c614.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/132979694ed6c10a8bf29caa6cd3c614.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/132979694ed6c10a8bf29caa6cd3c614.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each settler is a unique character. Consider Grimbold, for example. As a Swineherd, his Animal Handling is second to none. But his personality is Savage, so he\u2019d make a strong Brawler. He likes nice clothes, his religion is dear to him \u2014 and he\u2019s hungry. Satisfy Grimbold\u2019s needs, use his talents, and he\u2019ll be a happy settler \u2014 key to a happy settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/898513e3ad9383890604696aa3ea326d.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/ca7b10ecce5bf8a36ed58cfbfc56da21.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/ca7b10ecce5bf8a36ed58cfbfc56da21.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/ca7b10ecce5bf8a36ed58cfbfc56da21.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build impenetrable defenses and set traps against unrelenting waves of raiders. Research and craft medieval tech, arm your settlers and command them in battle. Tailor your strategy to your villager\u2019s skills, and upgrade them through hunting and combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/0148d6e8b8dff4427b0ce2269ff9b038.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5413f5bb55a33e271e474af10610c44d.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5413f5bb55a33e271e474af10610c44d.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5413f5bb55a33e271e474af10610c44d.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your randomly-generated multi-level map and manipulate it to your will. Terraform the earth and water for construction, design, or military strategy. Build up or dig down, go humble or baronial, and use the modding tools to unearth\u00a0a whole new level of creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We think you'll love Going Medieval if you enjoy...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RimWorld, Manor Lords, Kingdom Come: Deliverance II, Timberborn, Crusader Kings III, Civilization, Total War: Medieval II, Age of Empires IV, Frostpunk 2, Nova Roma, Kingdoms and Castles.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9ab9da0ad37b222edc5f779fec1ad1d971907412.jpg","localized_name":"Having A Field Day","name":"Having A Field Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/9ab9da0ad37b222edc5f779fec1ad1d971907412.jpg"},{"icon":"4fcaf1c9c4586a546c264835b1b214b488f53f0d.jpg","localized_name":"Green Thumb","name":"Green Thumb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/4fcaf1c9c4586a546c264835b1b214b488f53f0d.jpg"},{"icon":"d113ed4bc99645c7b57991d2e8000f7cb0c371d3.jpg","localized_name":"Home Cooked Meal","name":"Home Cooked Meal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/d113ed4bc99645c7b57991d2e8000f7cb0c371d3.jpg"},{"icon":"304d38958470d7b57c3a47f8f340586f0c6c1d6d.jpg","localized_name":"Fit For A King","name":"Fit For A King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/304d38958470d7b57c3a47f8f340586f0c6c1d6d.jpg"},{"icon":"f6f630bf2ef94279d3dc6cf6176fb17aeccc9d50.jpg","localized_name":"Novice Researcher","name":"Novice Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/f6f630bf2ef94279d3dc6cf6176fb17aeccc9d50.jpg"},{"icon":"dada6d4b5d529c515e65db6e9b33d218b5806b9b.jpg","localized_name":"Onward","name":"Onward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/dada6d4b5d529c515e65db6e9b33d218b5806b9b.jpg"},{"icon":"164681afc5fbb9fb77ac233a10c0884413a836fb.jpg","localized_name":"Beam Me Up","name":"Beam Me Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/164681afc5fbb9fb77ac233a10c0884413a836fb.jpg"},{"icon":"35442d8ad46f976d5510acd06fdcb1e188ac6c4a.jpg","localized_name":"Get A Room","name":"Get A Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/35442d8ad46f976d5510acd06fdcb1e188ac6c4a.jpg"},{"icon":"a86253820a33ed29a3c4bc17e7e4381c1653fdc7.jpg","localized_name":"Retribution","name":"Retribution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/a86253820a33ed29a3c4bc17e7e4381c1653fdc7.jpg"},{"icon":"cbb94c185886fa0c0117c3c9f395b76c11ec1a8d.jpg","localized_name":"The First Day","name":"The First Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029780/cbb94c185886fa0c0117c3c9f395b76c11ec1a8d.jpg"}],"total":94},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1029780?t=1776423113","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/14e90609291b4698f14a77734e557f7fcd9e1a2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776423113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/3ce35d479f05ecf55d5aaf6dab41df7abe18df19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776423113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/3ce35d479f05ecf55d5aaf6dab41df7abe18df19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776423113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1435830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/43c9412d7524bf1a17e0f6617cab3a12.avif?t=1776423113\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When civilization is decimated by rampant plague, a lucky few emerge from the ashes. Help them settle in a dangerous wilderness reclaimed by nature. Build them a home, shape their lives, and defend them from bandits and beasts in a lawless, realistic post-calamity world. The Dark Age is yours to rebuild. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5ed2d2f81df4483c2d08aaad7b3a4c1f.avif?t=1776423113\" width=637 height=68 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/67117a3652f18508f9e4abc33263b697.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/04acb3ed94691e24de9c6e408a45a62e.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/04acb3ed94691e24de9c6e408a45a62e.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/04acb3ed94691e24de9c6e408a45a62e.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From three lost travellers to a thriving walled city, build greatness from desolation. Use 3D terrain tools to create the perfect stronghold, from sprawling multi-storey forts to winding underground caverns. Construct, furnish and decorate your chambers, workshops, chapels, libraries and more, using stone, clay, and other gathered materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/a5299e73ceeba5b0700669c2d8d3ffe4.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/132979694ed6c10a8bf29caa6cd3c614.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/132979694ed6c10a8bf29caa6cd3c614.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/132979694ed6c10a8bf29caa6cd3c614.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each settler is a unique character. Consider Grimbold, for example. As a Swineherd, his Animal Handling is second to none. But his personality is Savage, so he\u2019d make a strong Brawler. He likes nice clothes, his religion is dear to him \u2014 and he\u2019s hungry. Satisfy Grimbold\u2019s needs, use his talents, and he\u2019ll be a happy settler \u2014 key to a happy settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/898513e3ad9383890604696aa3ea326d.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/ca7b10ecce5bf8a36ed58cfbfc56da21.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/ca7b10ecce5bf8a36ed58cfbfc56da21.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/ca7b10ecce5bf8a36ed58cfbfc56da21.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build impenetrable defenses and set traps against unrelenting waves of raiders. Research and craft medieval tech, arm your settlers and command them in battle. Tailor your strategy to your villager\u2019s skills, and upgrade them through hunting and combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/0148d6e8b8dff4427b0ce2269ff9b038.avif?t=1776423113\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5413f5bb55a33e271e474af10610c44d.poster.avif?t=1776423113\" width=780 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5413f5bb55a33e271e474af10610c44d.webm?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/extras/5413f5bb55a33e271e474af10610c44d.mp4?t=1776423113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your randomly-generated multi-level map and manipulate it to your will. Terraform the earth and water for construction, design, or military strategy. Build up or dig down, go humble or baronial, and use the modding tools to unearth\u00a0a whole new level of creative freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We think you'll love Going Medieval if you enjoy...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RimWorld, Manor Lords, Kingdom Come: Deliverance II, Timberborn, Crusader Kings III, Civilization, Total War: Medieval II, Age of Empires IV, Frostpunk 2, Nova Roma, Kingdoms and Castles.</i></p>","developers":["Foxy Voxel"],"dlc":[4400170,1612760],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029780/63deb4e3dec2e7db9b8fc60bed19cf9a0e0e1e01/header.jpg?t=1776423113","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":76,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/going-medieval?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029780/164612005/616bac485e1d6322dff091accc9156a4c5839610/1773679356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773759816","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029780/164612005/616bac485e1d6322dff091accc9156a4c5839610/1773679356/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773759816","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029780/164612005/616bac485e1d6322dff091accc9156a4c5839610/1773679356/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773759816","id":2573045